--   Sparse exact joint table for all six released global orientations
-- statement:
--   Literal sparse joint counts on four supported elementary CW triples, six hash-mode orientation maps, and the corresponding inverse coarse-shape permutations. Every conditional row has denominator 10^48. Reconstructed externally from the exact primitive seed; subsequent Lean theorems validate its intrinsic properties.
